<!--split-->
<h3>What It Tests For:</h3>
<p>Your sample will be analyzed at a certified lab for— but not limited to— heavy metals (25), minerals (4), hardness, turbidity, silica, inorganics like nitrate and nitrite, and coliform bacteria like <em>E. coli</em>.</p>
